                        Paul</orgName><p>Thomas Gascoigne intended to bequeath Balliol Coll. 45
                        and 46 to St Paul's, according to erased inscriptions in each volume, but it
                        is unlikely that the intention was carried out: on flyleaf of each volume
                        (erased): "Liber Magistri Thome Gascoigne sub illa [?] condicione quod post
                        mortem ipsius Thome tradatur librarie communi ecclesie cathedralis sancti
                        Pauli Londonie" (reading almost certain).</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Given to Balliol by William Gray, bishop of
